{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイブームは都内の美味しいグルメをひたすら調べて家族に写真を送りつけることです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これでももうすぐ高校3年生。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャームポイントは濃くて長い睫毛です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短所はテンションの浮き沈みが激しいところ。(by 原田 葵)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか自己紹介がしたくなりました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニックネームが欲しいです(°_°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近『いまいずみ〜』とか『いまゆい〜』っていろんな呼び方をしてくるひらち♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1B5KSM5Y5PNRV3811PV15","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}